        "text": "This chunk is about:\n- People: Judy Greer, Mitchell Hurwitz, Zach Galifianakis\n- TV Series: Arrested Development, It's Always Sunny in Philadelphia, Californication, Archer\n- Films: Visioneers\n- Roles: Kitty Sanchez, Ingrid Nelson/Fatty Magoo, Trixie, Cheryl Tunt\n- Places: Newport Beach, Culver City, Marina del Rey\n\nFacts:\n- Arrested Development is an American television sitcom created by Mitchell Hurwitz that originally aired on Fox for three seasons from November 2, 2003, to February 10, 2006.\n- Arrested Development is set in Newport Beach, California, and was filmed primarily in Culver City and Marina del Rey.\n- Judy Greer is known on television for playing Kitty Sanchez on Arrested Development, Ingrid Nelson/Fatty Magoo on It's Always Sunny in Philadelphia, Trixie on Californication, and Cheryl Tunt on Archer.\n- Visioneers stars Zach Galifianakis and Judy Greer.",
